# Coverage (PRD #103 M6). `coverage.out` was VESTIGIAL until this milestone -- it
# named tooling nothing produced, and the PRD's fix-the-doc list said M6 must either
# make it real or delete it. It is real now: `task test:api` and `task
# test:controller` write api/coverage.out and controller/coverage.out, and this
# pattern is unanchored so it matches both.
coverage.out
# ...and the two artifacts derived from them, plus vitest's. The Go .xml files are
# written beside their profiles by the cobertura conversion in the CI test jobs;
# vitest writes web/coverage/cobertura-coverage.xml (reportsDirectory in
# web/vite.config.ts). Nothing here is committed -- CI regenerates all of it, and
# `scan:secrets` walks TRACKED files only, so an ignored directory is out of its
# scope by construction.
coverage.xml
web/coverage/
